{{Term/Store|Goat Butter|Goat Butters|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC, AoI|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Material"/><ref name="AoI Materials"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Goat Butters are made from the [[Fresh Milk]] produced by [[White Goat]]s.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can be purchased at [[High Spirits Produce]] and [[The Slippery Falcon]], though the [[Merchant]] [[Agus]] also sells them. While they cannot be eaten, they can be used as an [[Ingredient]] in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make certain dishes. Goat Butters can also be used to make [[Yellow Dye]] at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]].

As part of the "[[What's for Dinner?]]" [[Side Quest]], [[Kiana]] asks [[Link]] to bring her a Goat Butter and a [[Hearty Blueshell Snail]] to make [[Seafood Paella]].<ref name="BotW Kiana"/> When Link brings them to Kiana, she will give him a [[Purple Rupee]] and a serving of Seafood Paella as a reward.<ref name="BotW Kiana 2"/><ref name="BotW Kiana 3"/> Similarly, the "[[Cooking with Koko]]" Side Quest requires Link to retrieve Goat Butter for [[Koko]], who wants to make a [[Hot Buttered Apple]].<ref name="BotW Koko"/> Once she has the Goat Butter, Koko will give him a Hot Buttered Apple as a reward.<ref name="BotW Koko 2"/>

